1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,185
Can you taste with your feet?

2
00:00:02,250 --> 00:00:04,095
Butterflies can!

3
00:00:04,125 --> 00:00:06,515
Big secrets of tiny bugs!

4
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:12,219
A butterfly lands on a flower, and tiny taste spots on its feet tell it right away:

5
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:14,609
Sweet! Time to eat!

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,136
What about crickets? Where are its ears?

7
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:21,446
Nope, not on its head!

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,797
A cricket's ears are on its front legs!

9
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,615
Honeybees can't talk, so they dance!

10
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,198
The dance tells the hive which way the flowers are, and how far.

11
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,743
Next time you're outside, look closely!

12
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:45,570
Hey... is it tasting me?
